### 13.1 Industry Trends

The energy sector is undergoing significant transformation driven by several key trends:

- **Decarbonization Efforts:** With global climate commitments, there is an increasing focus on reducing carbon emissions. ERC is actively participating in initiatives to transition to cleaner energy sources, including investments in renewable energy.

