### 13.3 Market Opportunities

- **Expansion into Emerging Markets:** ERC aims to expand operations into emerging markets in Asia and Africa, where energy demand is increasing. This strategic move is expected to provide new revenue streams and enhance global market presence.

- **Investing in Electrification:** ERC is exploring opportunities in electrification of transportation, with plans to develop electric vehicle (EV) charging stations across North America. This initiative aligns with the global shift towards sustainable transportation solutions.

